{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02741","headline":"奉和秋日即目应制 · 上官仪","name":"奉和秋日即目应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑通平乐，神池迩建章。\n楼台相掩映，城阙互相望。\n缇油泛行幔，箫吹转浮梁。\n晚云含朔气，斜照荡秋光。\n落叶飘蝉影，平流写雁行。\n槿散凌风缛，荷销裛露香。\n仙歌临枍诣，玄豫历长杨。\n归路乘明月，千门开未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}